00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:29.980
Thank you.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.840
over 30 degrees that's going to affect all sorts of things and significantly there is

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:43.680
mark surer the swiss driver fighting to retain his place in the brabham bmw team for 1986 and

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:51.170
ahead of his teammate double world champion nelson piquet on the grid that is gerhard berger's car

